"heading": "Reading complexity from code",
"chapter": "Measuring cost: complexity",
"url": "chapters/f2-complexity.html#reading-code",
"text": "Four rules cover most real code: Sequence adds: an O(n) loop followed by another O(n) loop is O(n + n) = O(n). Nesting multiplies: a loop of n iterations whose body does O(n) work is O(n × n) = O(n²)."
